    "Open the exact item page again on download day.",
    "Record creator, title, page URL, license URL and current license language.",
    "Record whether the item shows a Content ID badge or other creator restriction.",
    "Reject any newly conflicting restriction before downloading.",
    "Download the highest-quality allowed file without transcoding first.",
    "Compute SHA-256 and store it in the asset manifest.",
    "Save a license screenshot/certificate or equivalent evidence in the production archive.",
    "Create an in-game-friendly OGG import only after the source master and evidence are archived.",
    "Set loop points manually; never assume a track tagged loop is sample-perfect.",
    "Listen for clicks at loop boundaries on iPhone hardware.",
    "Check mono compatibility, dialogue masking and peak level.",
